# Porterchain stack & coding system (2026-07)

**Baseline (do not regress to older docs):**

| Layer | Version |
| ----- | ------- |
| Node | **24.18 LTS** (`.nvmrc`) · pnpm **11.10** |
| Python API/worker | **3.14.6** · FastAPI 0.139+ · Pydantic v2 · SQLAlchemy 2 |
| Web | **Next 16.2** · **React 19.2** · **TypeScript 6** · Tailwind 4 · ESLint 10 |
| Mobile | **Expo SDK 57** · RN 0.86 (blank shells until feature work) |
| Data | **Postgres 18** · **Redis 8.8** · **Mailpit** (not Mailhog) · Fleetbase cache **Valkey 8** |

See also `dependency-freeze.mdc` — no drive-by frontend bumps until ~2026-10.

## Checklist execution (dev vs prod)

- **Local before production:** test on this Mac, then local image build, then CI/CD. Never dispatch Deploy first. SSOT: `local-before-production.mdc`.
- **Dev layer first:** follow [PRIORITY_TODOS.md](../docs/PRIORITY_TODOS.md) + checklist items verifiable on localhost/CI.
- **Prod layer later:** Doppler, droplet, Fleetbase bridge, `validate:*:prod` — after dev layer complete.
- **Stripe:** Checkout remains the retail prepaid path. **Freeze lifted 2026-09-12** — additive COD via Stripe Connect + Payment Link/QR is allowed; do not break existing Checkout/webhooks.

## Secrets & Clerk (local = test, prod = Doppler)

- **Source of truth:** `env/clerk.env` → `pnpm clerk:sync` → API + all portals.
- API expects `CLERK_<PORTAL>_SECRET_KEY`, `_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`, `_JWKS_URL` — never ad-hoc names like `ADMIN_CLERK_SECRET_KEY`.
- **Local dev:** test keys in `env/clerk.env`; live keys in `env/clerk.env.prod-live.bak` and `infrastructure/deploy/scripts/clerk-keys.local.env`.
- Local API: `CLERK_DEV_BYPASS=true`; portals: `NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_DEV_BYPASS=true` (Bearer `dev`).

## Python (API / worker)

- Type hints + Pydantic v2 settings (`BaseSettings`, `model_validator`).
- Business logic in `*_engine/*_service.py`; routers stay thin.
- Star imports from `_deps` **must** export names in `__all__` (including `_foo` services).
- Postgres only (`postgresql+psycopg://`); Alembic for schema changes.
- Contract/API shapes must match portal TypeScript types (e.g. dashboard `trends: { labels, orders, revenue_cents }`).

## TypeScript / Next.js (web portals + website)

- App Router; `"use client"` only when needed; fetch via portal `lib/api.ts` → `:8001`.
- Data: **TanStack Query v5**; validation: **Zod 4**; auth: **@clerk/nextjs 7**.
- Shared UI: `@porterchain/ui`, env: `@porterchain/config`.
- No SocketCluster SDK in web apps; no Fleetbase HTTP from frontends.

## Docker / infra

- Exact image tags or digests in compose — never `:latest`.
- Valhalla: `ghcr.io/valhalla/valhalla-scripted@sha256:…` only.

## When docs disagree with repo

Trust **live `package.json` / `requirements.txt` / compose / `.nvmrc`** over stale markdown (e.g. old TECH_STACK Python 3.13, Expo 52, Mailhog).
